urdfdom_headers
------------------------------------------
The URDF (U-Robot Description Format) headers provides core data structure
headers for URDF.

Runtime requirements:
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/ros/urdfdom_headers

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/ros/urdfdom_headers/archive/refs/tags/3.0.1.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack urdfdom_headers-3.0.1-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./urdfdom_headers-3.0.1-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/urdfdom_headers-3.0.1-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/urdfdom_headers-3.0.1-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

